menu "Coin sound (MAX98357A I2S)"

    config AUDIO_PLAYER_ENABLE
        bool "Play the coin sound on an I2S amplifier"
        default n
        help
            The centralized speaker of the race-timing master (firmware/master;
            its amplifier pins are CONFIG_C6_AUDIO_*). Off by default. Needs
            components/audio_player/sounds/coin.pcm (tools/coin_sound.py). A
            detector (C5) has no amplifier and keeps this off.

endmenu
